  "display_title": "Hide Mansion",
  "description": "Burned-out from his job, Paul rents a remote cabin, Hide Mansion, to get away from everyone and everything. However, his plan to numb out is derailed when he finds a strange, albeit cute, intruder raiding his fridge. But Gerard’s petite frame belies his supernatural strength and thirst for blood. Paul hardly believes this doe-eyed boy is a vampire until the fangs are in his neck and a warm rush rouses his senses. Can the two misfits learn to live full lives, or will they drink each other dry?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
